Those are all good choices, but I usually select Xorn and Marilith:

For the Xorn:  Pretty good offense (two attacks, plus a bite), immune
		to stoning (eat cockatrice corpses!), breathes underwater
		(they don't drown like they used to), eats metal items (which
		makes it hard to starve; if you're adventurous you can eat
		metal rings for the intrinsics) and, of course, they 
		walk through walls, which makes those maze levels a mighty
		quick walk.

For the Marilith:  Six attacks, no waiting.  A veritable whirlwind
		of death with the right weapon.

Besides, everybody genocides Liches and Vampire Lords anyway.


